     "body": "<p>Testing notes:</p>\n\n<p>Tested against Inline, Managed and External datastreams, versioned and unversioned.  Output is as expected.  Also compared output with SOAP output and verified that all elements are returned as per SOAP call.</p>\n\n<p>Also verified format of output (xml and html) matches that of getDatastream</p>",
