  "description": "<p>Currently the REST api does not provide a way to get a datastream's version history &#8211; you've got to parse the foxml to get that info.  getDatastreamHistory should be exposed at</p>\n\n<p>/objects/</p>\n{pid}\n<p>/datastreams/</p>\n{dsID}\n<p>/versions</p>\n",
